tile.utilitycraft:steam_boiler.name=Steam Boiler
tile.utilitycraft:steam_boiler.tooltip=§r§7Converts water into steam for industrial machines.\n§7Tanks: 32,000 mB each for water and steam.\n§7Energy: 128 kDE · 2,400 DE per batch.\n§7Produces 1,000 mB in 8 s before upgrades.\n§7Accepts upgrades: §a§r, §b§r
entity.utilitycraft:steam_boiler.name=Steam Boiler
ui.utilitycraft:io.steam_boiler.items=Modos de E/S:\n§r- §9Entrada de contenedor liquido\n§r- §9Todas las entradas\n§r- §cTodas las salidas\n§r- §bEntrada de contenedor de gas\n§r- §cRetorno de contenedor\n§r- §cSalida de contenedor de Vapor
ui.utilitycraft:io.steam_boiler.liquids=Modos de E/S:\n§r- §9Entrada de liquido
ui.utilitycraft:io.steam_boiler.gases=Modos de E/S:\n§r- §cSalida de Vapor
ui.utilitycraft:info.steam_boiler=Converts water into steam using energy. 2 upgrades; 128 kDE; 32000 mB tanks. 1000 mB → 1000 mB; 2400 DE; 8 s. Upgrades to the Vaporizer.\n\n§eOperation\n§rSupply energy and liquid through the network or container slot. Empty buckets return to the lower slot. Insert empty capsules on the output side to collect steam.\n\n§eAutomation\n§rConfigure items, liquids and gases separately in the I/O panel. The liquid input receives fluid; gas output can supply the Arc-Press Forge. Processing pauses without energy or liquid, or when the output tank is full.\n\n§eUpgrades\n§rThe recipe book shows base values; upgrades and overclock affect processing.
ui.ascendant:recipe_book.steam_boiler.0.input=Water
ui.ascendant:recipe_book.steam_boiler.0.output=Steam
tile.utilitycraft:vaporizer.name=Vaporizer
tile.utilitycraft:vaporizer.tooltip=§r§7Advanced steam production from liquids.\n§7Accepts water, Cryofluid and Saline Coolant.\n§7Tanks: 128,000 mB · Energy: 1.024 MDE.\n§7Water: 1,000 mB steam in 4 s for 1,600 DE.\n§7Special fluids yield 50% more steam.\n§7Accepts upgrades: §a§r, §b§r, §d§r, §6§r
entity.utilitycraft:vaporizer.name=Vaporizer
ui.utilitycraft:io.vaporizer.items=Modos de E/S:\n§r- §9Entrada de contenedor liquido\n§r- §9Todas las entradas\n§r- §cTodas las salidas\n§r- §bEntrada de contenedor de gas\n§r- §cRetorno de contenedor\n§r- §cSalida de contenedor de Vapor
ui.utilitycraft:io.vaporizer.liquids=Modos de E/S:\n§r- §9Entrada de liquido
ui.utilitycraft:io.vaporizer.gases=Modos de E/S:\n§r- §cSalida de Vapor
ui.utilitycraft:info.vaporizer=Advanced steam processing. 4 upgrades; 1.024 MDE; 128000 mB tanks. Accepts water, Cryofluid and Saline Coolant.\n\n§eOperation\n§rSupply energy and liquid through the network or container slot. Empty buckets return to the lower slot. Insert empty capsules on the output side to collect steam.\n\n§eAutomation\n§rConfigure items, liquids and gases separately in the I/O panel. The liquid input receives fluid; gas output can supply the Arc-Press Forge. Processing pauses without energy or liquid, or when the output tank is full.\n\n§eUpgrades\n§rThe recipe book shows base values; upgrades and overclock affect processing.
