ui.ascendant:network.gainsNote=Generator rates are configured base values. Active rates use the sampled on/off state; upgrades, fuel, weather and output limits can change actual production. Batteries and Power Beacons do not count as generators.
ui.ascendant:network.lossesNote=The net loss is the decrease in total stored energy, not gross machine consumption. Distributors can send energy outside this wired network; their configured limit is not measured output. Zero-cost devices are excluded from the consumer list.
ui.ascendant:network.sampleNote=Net gains and losses use consecutive scans of the same complete network. Internal transfers cancel out. These approximate balances cannot separate simultaneous production and consumption. A dash means a comparable sample is unavailable.
ui.ascendant:network.capacityNote=Totals include the buffers of all connected devices. Battery storage is listed separately. The Center itself is excluded. Nominal battery transfer is a configured limit, not actual throughput.

